t split by country, so there is no data for recent years","LTU":"For multinational exchange groups such as Nasdaq Nordic and Baltic, the World Federation of Exchanges (WFE) publishes only group totals, which the World Bank does not split by country, so there is no data for recent years","ITA":"For multinational exchange groups such as the multinational group that owns Borsa Italiana (the London Stock Exchange Group until 2021, Euronext since), the World Federation of Exchanges (WFE) publishes only group totals, which the World Bank does not split by country, so there is no data for recent years","GBR":"The World Bank has no UK data for 2015–2020 (the London Stock Exchange Group then also owned Borsa Italiana, and the World Federation of Exchanges (WFE) published group totals); the WFE has published no London Stock Exchange data since 2023","TWN":"Taiwan is not in the World Bank database; figures for the Taiwan Stock Exchange plus the Taipei Exchange (TPEx) from the Financial Supervisory Commission's Securities and Futures Bureau are used instead: domestic companies only, as reported to the World Federation of Exchanges, excluding primary-listed foreign companies (KY companies; 89 on the Taiwan Stock Exchange and 29 on TPEx at the end of 2025), Taiwan depositary receipts and the emerging stock board; from 1998. The bureau has published the number of foreign companies only since 2020, so 2010–2019 are derived from Taiwan's count inside the World Bank's world total"},"encoding":"delta","aggregates":{"WLD":[0,17171,57,-373,1902,949,722,1536,1678,-171,15,41,918,246,3324,1886,3131,2203,1307,1561,574,1514,296,-1595,2157,-2326,368,4002,940,-84,-1280,758,896,-551,1081,890,-1760,-177,-366,-5518,10919,1214,2237,-1266,-2278,-768,-3403]},"values":{"ARG":[0,277,-15,-15,-10,-2,-9,-10,-11,-12,-10,-5,-9,1,-5,-9,-7,-2,-11,-5,-6,-3,-6,-6,-4,-3,-3,1,5,1,-6,0,-2,2,-4,-2,-2,0,3,-3,-2,0,-6,null,null,null,null],"ARM":[0,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,